# TEMPORARY PIN — remove when Debian ships a fixed imagemagick (> deb12u13).
#
# bookworm-security imagemagick 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13 segfaults in the
# internal SVG (MSVG) coder on arm64: php Imagick::readImageBlob() on any SVG
# dies with SIGSEGV, breaking the php_module_capabilities test in all
# bookworm-based php*-cli images. deb12u11 (bookworm main) is the last known
# good version. If this pinned version disappears from the archive, apt falls
# back to the security version and the image test suite will catch it again.
Package: imagemagick-6-common libmagickcore-6.q16-6 libmagickcore-6.q16-6-extra libmagickwand-6.q16-6
Pin: version 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u11
Pin-Priority: 1001
